OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fwith clear spells at first, cloudier
OL,7,Flater on but staying mostly dry. The
OL,8,Fwind eases light, which may allow a
OL,9,Ffew mist or fog patches to form in
OL,10,Frural spots. A milder night in cities.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloudy periods to start, with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain gradually pushing
OL,14,Feast, possibly turning heavy for some
OL,15,Fby the evening, before drier and
OL,16,Fclearer conditions settle in.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
