OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells to start on Monday, possibly
OL,7,Fbecoming cloudier and wetter for a
OL,8,Ftime. Cloudy and breezy on Tuesday
OL,9,Fwith an exceptionally warm night.
OL,10,FPartly cloudy with showers on
OL,11,FWednesday.
